{"ID":"20240118151123-0u4tzco","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151123-0u4tzco","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151123-0u4tzco\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151123-683cqv6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132211-f06v2ma\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132211-f06v2ma\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:200\u0026#125;","title":"202爵床","type":"doc","updated":"20240201134048"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151123-683cqv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151123-683cqv6","updated":"20240122132159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，寒，无毒。治腰脊病不得着床，俛仰艰难。除热，可做浴汤。生川谷及田野。又名香苏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132204-p1apvdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132204-p1apvdp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132207-xorryb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132207-xorryb9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132208-5h4sota","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132208-5h4sota"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】散瘀血，镇痛药，治腰痛及杖疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132210-v615ab3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132210-v615ab3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】疗血胀下气，治杖疮捣汁涂之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132210-kdcwexy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132210-kdcwexy"}},{"ID":"20240122132210-wsgzllh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132210-wsgzllh"}},{"ID":"20240122132210-w0m8jhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132210-w0m8jhm"}},{"ID":"20240122132211-f06v2ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132211-f06v2ma","updated":"20240201134048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"202，过去的名称我们叫爵床，现在我们叫香苏。讲香苏人家就知道了，讲爵床就就没有人知道。这个是背痛，腰痛，背痛使用得很多，弯，前后俯仰都不行的，使用的。当然你针灸也可以啊，我们用汤剂，用药物的话，香苏。但这个是味咸性寒的药，所以说一般，对一般的热症，急性的发作，效果很好。所以过去用这个爵床，就是香苏呢来散淤血，活血化淤。能够镇痛，止痛的药。还有杖疮，以前那个处罚就用军棍，那个打的疮，都可以使用。"}]}]}